# YouTrack issues

- Scrum board: https://botticelli.youtrack.cloud/projects/SMT
- Track tasks, sprints, and status against this board unless the user names another project.
- Issue prefixes are fixed. The repositories share one commit format; only the prefix changes:
  - TorgLink: `TRL-`
  - ShortP2P: `SHO-`
  - ShortP2P.LoRa: `SMT-`
- Use the prefix of the repository being changed. A TorgLink commit that only bumps a submodule still uses `TRL-`.
- Do not invent another prefix. If the ticket number is unknown, ask before creating a commit or an issue.
